# ClientID mode: wildcard certificate *.dns.<domain>, needed for the phone to present itself
# as <clientid>.dns.<domain> (SNI). In acme mode, it requires the DNS-01 challenge, hence a Caddy
# image built with the module of the DNS provider (see caddy/Dockerfile.dns and README).
dns.{$WATCHPOST_DOMAIN}, *.dns.{$WATCHPOST_DOMAIN} {
	import /etc/caddy-generated/dns-challenge.caddy
	import security
	respond "Watchpost: DNS-over-TLS resolver on port 853." 200
}
